\f1\b\fs48 \cf0 2. Top 3 risks to monitor\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\fs28 \cf0 Risk 1 \'97 Ethical certainty becoming rigidity\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 Your high ethical-leadership score is excellent, but you should watch for 
\f1\b moral certainty
\f0\b0 .\
The question isn't only:\
\'93Is my position ethical?\'94\
Also ask:\
\'93What legitimate information would cause me to change my mind?\'94\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b \cf0 Warning signs:
\f0\b0  becoming impatient with dissent, interpreting disagreement as poor character, or assuming your motives are cleaner than someone else's.\

\f1\b Countermeasure:
\f0\b0  actively solicit the strongest argument against your position.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\f1\b\fs28 \cf0 Risk 2 \'97 Strategic thinking becoming over-calculation\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

